A.b4K=new B.d("Adult (use actual body weight): 16 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 1000 mg/dose) IV \xd7 1. The recovery to T\u2081 of 10% baseline (relative to the time of administration of rocuronium or succinylcholine) was faster with rocuronium/sugammadex than with succinylcholine alone. This dose has not been evaluated for vecuronium-induced neuromuscular blockade.",!1)
