A.lKh=new B.a("In vitro",!1,!0,!1)
A.nnh=new B.a(" mixing of aminoglycosides with beta-lactam antibiotics (penicillin or cephalosporins) may result in a significant mutual inactivation. A reduction in serum half-life or serum level may occur when an aminoglycoside or penicillin-type drug is administered by separate routes. Inactivation of the aminoglycoside is clinically significant only in patients with severely impaired renal function. Inactivation may continue in specimens of body fluids collected for assay, resulting in inaccurate aminoglycoside readings. Such specimens should be properly handled (assayed promptly, frozen or treated with betalactamase) ",!1,!1,!1)
A.e7T=s([A.cT,A.bf,A.lKh,A.nnh,A.a6],t.p)
A.kRT=new B.b(A.e7T,null)
A.lBw=new B.a(" Clostridium difficile associated diarrhea has been reported and ranged from mild diarrhea to fatal colitis; discontinue use if suspected ",!1,!1,!1)
