A.mEE=new B.a("Primary outcomes:",!0,!1,!1)
A.nh_=new B.a(" All-cause mortality was not significantly different with high-dose caffeine therapy compared with standard dose therapy when used for any indication (relative risk{[RR], 0.86; 95% CI, 0.53 to 1.38; 5 studies, 723 patients). Similar results were obtained when broken down by indication (treatment of apnea, prevention of apnea, or prevention of reintubation) ",!1,!1,!1)
