A.lCt=new B.a("A retrospective study of 410 infants 28 weeks gestational age (GA) or younger (median GA, 26 weeks) treated with caffeine citrate at higher doses and for longer durations than is FDA-approved (median loading dose, 20 mg/kg; median maintenance dose, 8 mg/kg/day; median duration, 60 days) reported the following ",!1,!1,!1)
