A.ncY=new B.a(". A secondary analysis (n=675) of a retrospective, multicenter cohort study demonstrated an association of less frequent early acute kidney injury in preterm neonates with caffeine administered by 7 days of life; 11.2% vs 31.6% with and without caffeine, respectively (adjusted odds ratio 0.2 (95% CI, 0.11 to 0.34)) ",!1,!1,!1)
