A.mZE=new B.a(". Follow-up in 78 newborns (39 in both the fentaNYL and placebo groups) at 2 years of corrected age demonstrated a significant decrease in eye and hand coordination skills in the newborns administered fentaNYL continuous infusion versus bolus only. No difference was demonstrated for locomotor, personal and social skills, hearing and language, and performance ",!1,!1,!1)
