A.mRY=new B.a(" Long-term outcomes are not improved when preterm infants, younger than 14 days, are treated routinely for patent ductus arteriosus. Treatment benefits when administered after 2 weeks of age or in high-risk infants in the first 2 postnatal weeks are unknown ",!1,!1,!1)
