A.lAO=new B.a(". In a one-year follow-up of these 2 studies (n=1546), lucinactant had similar efficacy to the animal-derived and synthetic exogenous surfactant products for decreasing mortality and morbidity rates in premature neonates at risk for RDS. Neurologic function was similar in infants who received lucinactant and those that received other surfactants ",!1,!1,!1)
