A.ns1=new B.a(" In infants with Type 1 retinopathy of prematurity, one intravitreal ranibizumab injection typically results in initial regression in all treated eyes ",!1,!1,!1)
A.as7=new B.a("[4][1][2]",!1,!1,!0)
A.nui=new B.a(". In a prospective randomized trial, recurrence occurred significantly more often with ranibizumab than with laser photocoagulation (LPC) therapy in patients with Zone II, Stages 2 or 3 ROP with plus disease ",!1,!1,!1)
A.m3h=new B.a(". A large retrospective case series reported a higher rate of recurrence with ranibizumab compared with bevacizumab or LPC but treatment groups differed significantly in relation to baseline characteristics ",!1,!1,!1)
A.mif=new B.a(". Vascular abnormalities may persist after primary treatment with ranibizumab ",!1,!1,!1)
A.mcS=new B.a(". Systemic vascular endothelial growth factor suppression was not sustained with intravitreal doses of 0.12 mg or 0.2 mg in 19 infants ",!1,!1,!1)
A.nqZ=new B.a(". Intravitreal ranibizumab is well tolerated ",!1,!1,!1)
A.myF=new B.a(" but long-term systemic effects are unknown for ranibizumab ",!1,!1,!1)
A.mUN=new B.a("[4][1]",!1,!1,!0)
