A.k2T=new B.b(A.e85,null)
A.nqd=new B.a("Topiramate has been safely used, in concert with deep or mild hypothermia, for HIE in full-term newborns (n=27). An initial dose of 5 mg/kg (by orogastric tube) was started at initiation of hypothermia, followed by doses of either 5 mg/kg or 3 mg/kg given on days 2 and 3 ",!1,!1,!1)
