A.m_l=new B.a(". At 2 years of age, cognitive scores, neurodevelopment, language, and respiratory outcomes were not different between vitamin D and placebo (n=70). Although underpowered, 800 international units of vitamin D did not result in improvement in any outcomes at 2 years of age compared with 200 international units or placebo ",!1,!1,!1)
