A.bEo=new B.d("Nasal (safety for an average of >4 headaches in a 30-day period has not been established; see remarks):",!0)
A.bfC=new B.d("\u226512 yr and adult: Start with 2.5 mg inhaled into a single nostril \xd7 1. If needed in 2 hr, a second dose may be administered. Dose may be increased to a maximum single dose of 5 mg if needed. Max. daily dose: 10 mg/24 hr",!1)
A.Zr=new B.d("Patients receiving concurrent cimetidine: Limit maximum doses to 2.5 mg as the max. single dose and do not exceed 5 mg in any 24-hr period.",!1)
A.bHN=new B.d("Oral (use not recommended in children; safety and efficacy in children have not been established with the oral route. One randomized placebo-controlled trial in 696 adolescents 12\u201317 yr old did not establish efficacy and had adverse events similar to those seen in adult trials):",!0)
A.bqU=new B.d("Adult (safety for an average of >3 headaches in a 30-day period has not been established; see remarks):",!0)
A.bKH=new B.d("PO or ODT tabs: Start with 2.5 mg PO \xd7 1. If needed in 2 hr, a second dose may be administered. Dose may be increased to a maximum single dose of 5 mg if needed. Max. daily dose: 10 mg/24 hr",!1)
