A.bol=new B.d("Adjunctive therapy for partial seizures: 100 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 wk. Dose may be increased to 200 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 wk. Additional dosage increments of 100 mg/24 hr can be made at 2-wk intervals to allow attainment of steady-state levels. Effective doses have ranged from 100 mg to 600 mg/24 hr \xf7 once daily\u2013BID (BID dosing may provide better efficacy). No additional benefit has been shown for doses >400 mg/24 hr.",!1)
