A.dxT=s(["Injection: 100 mg/mL (10%) (500 mL); 200 mg/mL (20%) (250, 500 mL); 250 mg/mL (25%) (50 mL)","Inhalation powder in capsules:","Bronchitol: 40 mg (10s, 140s, 560s with 1, 1, and 4 inhalers, respectively)","Aridol (graduated dose kit in 3 blister packs):","Blister pack 1: one capsule each of 0, 5, 10, and 20 mg marked 1, 2, 3, and 4, respectively","Blister pack 2: 40-mg capsules marked as 5 (one capsule), 6 (two capsules), and 7 (four capsules)","Blister pack 3: 40-mg capsules marked as 8 and 9 (both containing four capsules)"],t.s)
