A.hEo=s(["Injection: 1 mg/mL (10, 20, 50 mL); single-dose use products are preservative free","Premixed injection in D\u2085W: 200 mCg/mL (100, 200 mL); preservative free"],t.s)
A.bv5=new B.d("Optional 50-mCg/kg IV loading dose over 15 min, followed by a continuous infusion of 0.25\u20130.75 mCg/kg/min and titrate to effect. Loading dose is NOT recommended by some due to the risk of hypotension.",!1)
