A.eq9=s(["Contraindicated in severe aortic stenosis, severe pulmonic stenosis, and acute MI. May cause headache, dysrhythmias, hypotension, hypokalemia, nausea, vomiting, anorexia, abdominal pain, hepatotoxicity, and thrombocytopenia. Pediatric patients may require higher mCg/kg/min doses because of a faster elimination T\u2081/\u2082 and larger volume of distribution, when compared with adults. Hemodynamic effects can last up to 3\u20135 hr after discontinuation of infusion in children. Reduce dose in renal impairment."],t.s)
