A.iaR=s(["Tabs: 2.5, 10 mg","Topical solution:","Minoxidil for Men, Minoxidil for Women, Rogaine, and generics (OTC): 2% (60 mL); contains alcohol and propylene glycol","Hair Regrowth Treatment for Men, Men\u2019s Rogaine Extra Strength, Minoxidil Extra Strength for Men, Gainextra Hair Regrowth, and generics (OTC): 5% (60, 120 mL); contains 30% alcohol","Topical foam:","Rogaine Men\u2019s, Rogaine Women\u2019s, Rogaine Men\u2019s Extra Strength, and Gainextra Mens (OTC): 5% (60 g); contains cetyl alcohol"],t.s)
A.b0B=new B.d("Child <12 yr: Start with 0.1\u20130.2 mg/kg/24 hr PO once daily; max. dose: 5 mg/24 hr. Dose may be increased in increments of 0.1\u20130.2 mg/kg/24 hr at 3-day intervals. Usual effective range: 0.25\u20131 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 once daily\u2013TID; max. dose: 50 mg/24 hr",!1)
