A.cYI=s(["Avoid contact with the eyes. Topical cream is not intended for use in lesions >10 cm in length or 100 cm\xb2 in surface area. Do not use topical ointment preparation on open wounds because of concerns about systemic absorption of polyethylene glycol. May cause minor local irritation and dry skin. Intranasal route may cause nasal stinging, taste disorder, headache, rhinitis, and pharyngitis. Severe allergic reactions (e.g., anaphylaxis, urticaria, angioedema, and rash) have been reported.","If clinical response is not apparent in 3\u20135 days with topical use, reevaluate infection."],t.s)
