A.i8O=s(["Injection (generics; previously available as Cytovene): 500 mg; contains 4 mEq Na per 1 g drug","Injection in solution: 500 mg/10 mL (10 mL)","Premixed injection in 0.8% sodium chloride: 500 mg/250 mL (250 mL); preservative free","Ophthalmic gel (drops):","Zirgan: 0.15% (5 g); contains benzalkonium chloride"],t.s)
