A.eB7=s(["Tabs (Glycate, and generics): 1, 1.5, 2 mg","Oral solution (Cuvposa and generics): 1 mg/5 mL (473 mL); contains propylene glycol and parabens","Injection (Glyrx-PF and generics): 0.2 mg/mL (1, 2, 3, 5, 20 mL); some multidose vials contain 0.9% benzyl alcohol"],t.s)
