A.bCL=new B.d("IM administration: Administer in the anterolateral aspects of the upper thigh or deltoid muscle of the upper arm. Avoid gluteal region due to risk of injury to sciatic nerve. Consider splitting doses for multiple injection sites to address age-specific maximum IM injection volumes.",!1)
