A.hYG=s(["Accidental mix-ups between insulin products have been reported. Always check the insulin label before each use or injection.","When using insulin drip with new IV tubing, before connecting tubing to the patient, fill the tubing with the insulin infusion solution, and wait for 30 min. Then flush the line and connect the IV line to the patient to start the infusion. This will ensure proper drug delivery. Adjust dose in renal failure (see Chapter 32). Use with caution and monitor closely in hepatic impairment."],t.s)
