A.b2T=new B.d("Total replacement dose of iron dextran (mL) = 0.0442 \xd7 lean body wt (kg) \xd7 (desired Hb [g/dL] \u223c measured Hb [g/dL]) + (0.26 \xd7 lean body wt [kg]). For patients weighing 5\u201315 kg, use actual body weight instead of lean body weight. Total replacement dose is divided into smaller daily doses if exceeds respective IV or IM daily max. doses (see below).",!1)
