A.bPG=new B.l("HIV vertical transmission and presumptive treatment during high-risk situations: mothers who received no antepartum antiretroviral therapy, mothers who received only intrapartum antiretroviral therapy, mothers who received antepartum antiretroviral therapy, but with suboptimal viral suppression (\u226550 copies/mL) within 4 weeks prior to delivery, or mothers with acute or primary HIV infection during pregnancy or breastfeeding (immediately discontinue breastfeeding). Transition to a treatment regimen if positive HIV diagnosis is confirmed and discontinue use after a negative diagnosis; see Chapter 17 for additional information:",A.hSE,null)
