A.bu1=new B.d("Already taking a strong CYP3A inhibitor and initiating Orkambi: Reduce Orkambi dosage to 1 tablet or 1 packet of granules every other day \xd7 the first week followed by the recommended daily dose. If Orkambi is interrupted for >1 wk and reinitiated while taking strong CYP3A inhibitor, Orkambi should be reintroduced with the reduced dosage of 1 tablet or 1 packet of granules every other day \xd7 1 wk followed by the recommended daily dose.",!1)
