A.bN0=new B.d("Controlled-release tabs (Paxil CR and generics): Start with 25 mg PO QAM \xd7 4 wk. If no improvement, increase dose by 12.5 mg/24 hr Q7 days PRN up to a max. dose of 62.5 mg/24 hr.",!1)
A.bJB=new B.d("Obsessive-compulsive disorder (immediate release): Start with 20 mg PO once daily; increase dose by 10 mg/24 hr Q7 days PRN up to a max. dose of 60 mg/24 hr. Usual dose is 40 mg PO once daily. Rapid metabolizers may require doses as high as 100 mg/24 hr.",!1)
A.b11=new B.d("Panic disorder:",!0)
