A.epY=s(["See Penicillin G Preparations\u2013Aqueous Potassium and Sodium for side effects and drug interactions. GI absorption is better than penicillin G. Note: Must be taken 1 hr before or 2 hr after meals. Penicillin will prevent rheumatic fever if started within 9 days of the acute illness. Adjust dose in renal failure (see Chapter 32)."],t.s)
