A.dGU=s(["Chewable tabs (Dilantin Infatab, Phenytoin Infatabs, and generics): 50 mg; may contain saccharin, and some products may be scored","Extended-release caps:","Dilantin: 30, 100 mg","Phenytek: 200, 300 mg","Generics: 100, 200, 300 mg","Oral suspension (Dilantin and generics): 125 mg/5 mL (240 mL); contains \u22640.6% alcohol and sodium benzoate","Injection: 50 mg/mL (2, 5 mL); contains alcohol and sodium benzoate"],t.s)
A.bLy=new B.d("See Chapter 1 and remarks. Fosphenytoin is the preferred IV dosage form due to lower risk for side effects.",!1)
