A.aUq=new B.d("Child: 0.02 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 0.5 mg/dose) IM or IV (administered no >0.5 mg/min); dose may be repeated every 5\u201310 min if no response or return of anticholinergic symptoms up to a max. total of 2 mg",!1)
