A.fUf=s(["Tabs (Mephyton and generics): 5 mg; may be scored","Oral suspension: 1 mg/mL","Injection, emulsion (contains no more than 500 mCg/L aluminum):","2 mg/mL (0.5 mL); some preparations may be preservative free but may contain propylene glycol","10 mg/mL (1 mL); contains 0.9% benzyl alcohol"],t.s)
