A.bGd=new B.d("Adult: 5 mg/dose PO TID; dose may be titrated to 10 mg/dose PO TID in patients who do not respond to lower dose and who are able to tolerate the drug. Also, 5 mg/dose PO QID has been used in Sj\xf6gren syndrome.",!1)
