A.bhs=new B.d("For patients with a postmenstrual age of >35 wk, a pharmacokinetic study suggests using 80 mg/kg/dose IV Q4 hr to achieve targeted drug concentration time above the minimum inhibitory concentration (MIC). Prolonged dose infusion times of 3 hours can improve the pharmacodynamic concentration time above the MIC and may be useful for pathogens with higher MICs. Postmenstrual age = gestational age + postnatal age.",!1)
