A.etX=s(["Injection (Protopam): 1000 mg","In combination with atropine (ATNNA):","Injection for intramuscular injection in autoinjector device: 600 mg/2 mL of pralidoxime and 2.1 mg/0.7 mL of atropine; contains benzyl alcohol. ATNNA must be administered by emergency medical services personnel who have had adequate training in the recognition and treatment of nerve agent or insecticide intoxication."],t.s)
