A.hGN=s(["See Prednisone for remarks. See Chapter 10 for relative steroid potencies. Pregnancy category changes to \u201cD\u201d if used in the first trimester.","OPHTHALMIC USE: Contraindicated in viral (e.g., herpes simplex, vaccinia, and varicella), fungal, and mycobacterial infections of the cornea and conjunctiva. Increase in intraocular pressure, cataract formation, eye pain, and delayed wound healing may occur."],t.s)
