A.bpE=new B.d("Solution: Instill 1\u20132 drops into the conjunctival sac(s) of the affected eye(s) Q1 hr during the day and Q2 hr during the night as initial therapy. When a favorable response is achieved, reduce dosage to Q3\u20134 hr. Further dose reduction to 1 drop TID\u2013QID may be sufficient to control symptoms.",!1)
A.b6J=new B.d("Suspension: Shake well before using. For mild disease, instill 1\u20132 drops in the conjunctival sac(s) of the affected eye(s) up to 4\u20136 times/24 hr. For severe disease, drops may be used Q1 hr, being tapered to discontinuation as inflammation subsides. BID dosing has been effective in controlling inflammation in children \u226410 yr old after strabismus surgery.",!1)
