A.fv9=s(["Contraindicated if hypersensitive to sheep products. Use with caution in renal or cardiac failure. May cause rapidly developing severe hypokalemia, decreased cardiac output (from withdrawal of digoxin\u2019s inotropic effects), rash, edema, and phlebitis. Digoxin therapy may be reinstituted in 3\u20137 days, when toxicity has been corrected. Digoxin immune Fab will interfere with digitalis immunoassay measurements to result in misleading concentrations."],t.s)
