A.bnY=new B.d("Extended release: 120\u2013360 mg/24 hr PO once daily\u2013BID (BID dosing with Q12 hr extended-release generic capsule; once-daily dosing with extended-release tab, Cardizem CD, Cartia XT, Cardizem LA, Dilt-XR, Matzim LA, Tiadylt ER, Tiazac, and Q24 hr generic extended-release capsule or tab); max. dose: 540 mg/24 hr",!1)
