A.ibi=s(["Causes drowsiness and anticholinergic side effects. May mask vestibular symptoms and cause CNS excitation in young children. Caution when taken with ototoxic agents or history of seizures. Use should be limited to management of prolonged vomiting of known etiology. Not recommended in children <2 yr. Toxicity resembles anticholinergic poisoning."],t.s)
