A.fgU=s(["Tabs (Calphron [OTC] and generics): 667 mg (169 mg elemental Ca)","Capsules (generics; previously available as PhosLo): 667 mg (169 mg elemental Ca)","Each 1 g of salt contains 12.7 mEq or 6.34 mmol (250 mg) elemental Ca."],t.s)
