A.b7F=new B.d("Adolescent and adult: Initially, 12.5\u201325 mg/dose PO BID\u2013TID; increase weekly if necessary by 25 mg/dose to max. dose: 450 mg/24 hr. Usual dosage range: 25\u2013100 mg/24 hr \xf7 BID",!1)
