A.bgZ=new B.d("\u226512 yr and adult (PO): 0.1 mg BID initially; increase in 0.1 mg/24 hr increments at weekly intervals until desired response is achieved (usual range: adolescent: 0.2\u20130.6 mg/24 hr \xf7 BID; adult: 0.1\u20130.8 mg/24 hr \xf7 BID); max. dose: 2.4 mg/24 hr",!1)
