A.btz=new B.d("Continuous infusion (child and adult): 0.005 mg/kg loading dose followed by infusion of 0.0025 mg/kg/hr has been recommended. A range of 0.0025\u20130.16 mg/kg/hr has been reported. Taper gradually to avoid relapse.",!1)
