A.dY7=s(["Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to milk proteins. See Fluticasone Preparations for remarks. Vilanterol is a long-acting \u03b2\u2082-adrenergic agonist with a faster onset and longer duration of action compared to salmeterol.","Hypersensitivity reactions, hyperglycemia, muscle spasms, and tremor have been reported.","Titrate to the lowest effective strength after asthma is adequately controlled. This dosage form\u2019s breath-activated device requires a minimum inspiratory flow rate of 60 L/min for proper dose activation. Proper patient education, including dosage administration technique, is essential; see patient package insert for detailed instructions. Rinse mouth after each use."],t.s)
