A.btV=new B.d("Child 8\u201312 yr: Start at 12.5\u201325 mg PO QHS. Dose may be increased by 25 mg/24 hr Q7\u201314 days (slower titration at Q2\u20134 wk may be used for minimizing behavioral side effects). Total daily doses >50 mg/24 hr should be divided BID. Female patients may require lower dosages compared to males.",!1)
A.aWZ=new B.d("Max. dose: Child: 8\u201311 yr: 200 mg/24 hr; and child 12 yr: 300 mg/24 hr",!1)
A.bzS=new B.d("Adolescent: Start at 25\u201350 mg PO QHS. Dose may be increased by 25 mg/24 hr Q7\u201314 days (slower titration at Q2\u20134 wk may be used for minimizing behavioral side effects). Total daily doses >50 mg/24 hr should be divided BID with the larger dose at bedtime. Max. dose: 300 mg/24 hr",!1)
A.b5U=new B.d("Adult: Start at 50 mg PO QHS. Dose may be increased by 50 mg/24 hr Q4\u20137 days up to a max. dose of 300 mg/24 hr. Total daily doses >100 mg/24 hr should be divided BID with larger dose at bedtime.",!1)
A.b46=new B.d("Extended-release capsule (adult): Start at 100 mg PO QHS. Dose may be increased by 50 mg/24 hr Q7 days up to a max. dose of 300 mg/24 hr.",!1)
