A.hjy=s(["Fetal movement may be sensed now (called quickening). Some mothers don't feel the fetus moving until about 25 weeks.","The average fetus at 15 weeks is 6.6 inches (16.7 cm) long and weighs 4.1 ounces (117 grams)."],t.s)
