A.bBO=new B.d("Three-times-a-week dosing regimen (adult): If no increase in Hgb >1 g/dL and Hgb remains <10 g/dL after initial 4 wk of therapy, increase dosage to 300 U/kg/dose 3 times per week.",!1)
