A.b5k=new B.d("250 U/kg/dose SC 3 times per wk \xd7 10 doses; alternatively, 200\u2013400 U/kg/dose IV/SC 3\u20135 times per week for 2\u20136 wk (total dose per week is 600\u20131400 U/kg). Administer with supplemental iron at 3\u20136 mg elemental iron/kg/24 hr.",!1)
