A.eUt=s([A.bO7],t.T)
A.fUi=s(["Contraindicated in 2nd-degree and 3rd-degree AV block or sick sinus syndrome unless pacemaker placed. Use with caution in combination with digoxin (enhanced depressant effects on SA and AV nodes). If necessary, doses may be administered IO. T\u2081/\u2082: <10 sec.","May precipitate bronchoconstriction, especially in asthmatics. Side effects include transient asystole, facial flushing, headache, shortness of breath, dyspnea, nausea, chest pain, and lightheadedness.","Carbamazepine and dipyridamole may increase the effects and toxicity of adenosine, respectively Methylxanthines (e.g., caffeine and theophylline) may decrease the effects of adenosine."],t.s)
