A.e13=s(["Contraindicated in cases of CHF or severe anemia; rapid infusion may cause fluid overload; hypersensitivity reactions may occur; may cause rapid increase in serum sodium levels. Recommended maximum infusion rates:","Caution: 25% concentration is considered contraindicated in preterm infants due to risk of IVH. Use product-specific recommended in-line filter size. Both 5% and 25% products are isotonic but differ in oncotic effects. Dilutions of the 25% product should be made with D\u2085W or NS; avoid sterile water as a diluent."],t.s)
