A.aTw=new B.d("\u226516 yr and adult (\u226540 kg): 2 g Q12 hr PO \xd7 10 days for acute bacterial sinusitis, 7\u201310 days for community-acquired pneumonia, or 5\u201310 days for acute otitis media",!1)
