A.bpP=new B.d("\u226513 yr and adult: 10 mg QAM; increase by 10 mg/24 hr at weekly intervals until desired response. Incremental doses may be administered with the first dose at awakening and subsequent doses (5 or 10 mg) spaced at 4\u20136 hr intervals. Usual daily dosage range: 5\u201360 mg/24 hr in divided doses.",!1)
