A.b5X=new B.d("13\u201317 yr: Start at 2 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 days, followed by 5 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 days, then to the recommended target dose of 10 mg PO once daily. If necessary, dose may be increased in 5-mg increments up to a maximum of 30 mg/24 hr (30 mg/24 hr was not shown to be more effective than 10 mg/24 hr in clinical trials). Patients should be periodically evaluated to determine the continued need for maintenance treatment.",!1)
