A.c0U=new B.l("Bipolar I Disorder (monotherapy or adjunctive therapy):",A.cYh,null)
A.bH_=new B.d("6\u201318 yr (patients should be periodically evaluated to determine the continued need for maintenance treatment):",!0)
A.beh=new B.d("<50 kg: Start at 2 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 days, then increase to the target dose of 5 mg PO once daily. If necessary after 7 days, dose may be increased to 10 mg PO once daily.",!1)
A.bDx=new B.d("\u226550 kg: Start at 2 mg PO once daily \xd7 2 days, followed by 5 mg PO once daily \xd7 5 days, and then 10 mg PO once daily. If necessary after 7 days, dose may be increased in 5-mg increments of \u22657 days in duration up to a maximum of 20 mg/24 hr.",!1)
