A.aU9=new B.d("Child \u226510 yr and adult: Start with 25 mg PO BID \xd7 7 days, then increase by 50 mg/24 hr increments at 1-wk intervals up to a max. dose of 100 mg PO BID at wk 4. If needed, dose may be further increased at weekly intervals by 100 mg/24 hr up to a recommended max. dose of 200 mg PO BID.",!1)
