A.bar=new B.d("\u226512 yr and adult (use 10 mg/mL strength): Inject up to 1 mg/site \xd7 1 and may be repeated \xd7 1 or more times weekly. May give separate doses in sites \u22651 cm apart, not to exceed 30 mg.",!1)
