A.bru=new B.d("Conjunctivitis: 1\u20132 drops to affected eye(s) 2\u20134 hr while awake \xd7 2 days, then QID \xd7 5 additional days",!1)
A.bjY=new B.d("Corneal ulcer: 1\u20132 drops to affected eye(s) Q30 min while awake and Q4\u20136 hr while asleep at night \xd7 2 days, followed by Q1 hr while awake \xd7 5 days, and then QID until treatment has been completed",!1)
