A.bfL=new B.d("\u22656 to <12 yr: Start at 1 spray (32 mCg) in each nostril once daily. If needed, increase to 2 sprays (64 mCg) in each nostril once daily, then reduce dose back to initial dose when symptoms improve. Max. nasal dose: 128 mCg/24 hr (4 sprays/24 hr).",!1)
