A.b0y=new B.d("In addition, a report in 10\u201319-yr-old children demonstrated higher remission rates with an induction dose of 12 mg PO once daily \xd7 4 wk, followed by 9 mg PO once daily \xd7 3 wk, followed by 6 mg PO once daily \xd7 3 wk.",!1)
