A.e7U=s(["Tabs (Sabril, Vigadrone, and generics): 500 mg; may be scored","Oral solution (Vigafyde): 100 mg/mL (150 mL); contains parabens and sucralose","Powder for oral solution (Sabril, Vigadrone, Vigpoder, and generics): 500 mg per packet to be dissolved in 10 mL water to make a 50 mg/mL solution (50s)"],t.s)
A.bmM=new B.d("Start at 50 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID; if needed and tolerated, may titrate dosage upward by 25\u201350 mg/kg/24 hr increments Q3 days up to a maximum of 150 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID. Gradually withdraw therapy (see remarks) if no clinical benefit is seen in 2\u20134 wk.",!1)
