A.bQ0=new B.l("Empirical doses; consider drug interactions and pharmacogenomic-based recommendations (see remarks). Between-patient and inter-occasion pharmacokinetic variability is high. Monitor trough level and adjust dose accordingly.",A.an,null)
A.aSh=new B.d("Start with 9 mg/kg/dose IV/PO Q12 hr; monitor levels and adjust dose. Median dose of 31.5 mg/kg/24 hr \xf7 12 hr (range: 12\u201371 mg/kg/24 hr) has been reported to achieve target trough levels.",!1)
